{"ref":"BDB, גֹּב²","hw":"גֹּב²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גֹּב</span></big>  <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:18\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.18\">2 S 21:18</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גּוֹב</span> v <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:19\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.19\">19</a> <strong>n.pr.loc. (</strong>cf. Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">גֻּבָּא</span> <em>den</em>, and <span dir=\"rtl\">ܓܘܽܒܳܐ</span>, Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">جُبٌّ</span>, Ethiopic ግብ Assyrian <em>gubbu</em>, <em>well, cistern</em>, v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, גבב\" href=\"/BDB,_גבב\", dir=\"rtl\">גבב</a><strong>)</strong>—field of battle with Philistines <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:18\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.18\">2 S 21:18</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">גֶּזֶר</span> in ‖ <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 20:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.20.4\">1 Ch 20:4</a> (so here Th Ew; cf. <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:33\" href=\"/Joshua.10.33\">Jos 10:33</a>), but = <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּת</span> 𝔊 𝔖 <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:18\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.18\">2 S 21:18</a> (𝔊L Γαζεθ); <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:9\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.9\">2 S 21:9</a> (om. ‖ <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 20:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.20.5\">1 Ch 20:5</a>), 𝔊 Ρομ, Ροβ; Klo <em>Gath;</em> in v <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:16\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.16\">16</a> We Dr (q.v.) read <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּגֹב</span> for <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֹב</span>; site of Gob (si vera l.) unknown.","next":"BDB, גַּבַּי סַלָּ֑י","prev":"BDB, גַּב²"}